# IP Mapping & Readdressing with DHCP

## Using DHCP for Dynamic Address Assignment

### Linux (dhclient)
```bash
sudo dhclient eth0

```

### Windows (renew IP)
```powershell
ipconfig /release
ipconfig /renew
```

### View DHCP Lease
- Linux: `cat /var/lib/dhcp/dhclient.leases`
- Windows: `ipconfig /all`

## DHCP Tools
- [isc-dhcp-server](https://help.ubuntu.com/community/ISC-DHCP-Server)
- [dnsmasq](https://thekelleys.org.uk/dnsmasq/doc.html)

## DHCP Server Example (Linux)
```bash
sudo apt install isc-dhcp-server
sudo nano /etc/dhcp/dhcpd.conf
# Configure subnet, range, etc.
sudo systemctl start isc-dhcp-server
```

